---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="About" description={`About ${site.name}`}>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1>About me</h1>
  </header>

  <!-- 把下面几段换成你自己的故事。每个 <p> 是一段。 -->
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I grew up taking things apart to see how they worked, and mostly failing to put them back
      together. These days I do the same thing with data and software, with a better success rate.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm currently looking for roles where I can work close to the people using what I build.
      I like small teams, clear problems, and shipping something useful every week.
    </p>

    <h2>Outside of work</h2>
    <p>
      I cook a lot, usually from a recipe I've misread. I'm training for my first half marathon,
      and I keep a running list of every bakery I pass on long runs. I write here about both, and about
      whatever I'm learning at the time.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is email{site.email && <>: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></>}.
      {site.links.length > 0 && <> I'm also on {site.links.map((l, i) => (
        <>{i > 0 && (i === site.links.length - 1 ? ' and ' : ', ')}<a href={l.href} rel="me">{l.label}</a></>
      ))}.</>}
      {site.resume && <> You can also download my <a href={site.resume}>résumé</a>.</>}
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
